| `role` | `all` | R | `all`/`api`/`coordinator` |
| `listen.client` | `0.0.0.0:8443` | R | 浏览器/SDK HTTPS+WSS |
| `listen.node` | `0.0.0.0:7443` | R | 节点 mTLS |
